          "message": "EVAL-V2-03 is an inconsistent baseline-complete case labeled ready.",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "category": "logic-error",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "EVAL-V2-03 is labeled baseline-complete with expected state ready, but its component status, LLP trace, release certificate, and lease return conditions give conflicting dates.",
            "failureScenario": "A runner treating this as a complete baseline receives a status-list install date of 16 Apr 2015 and a return date of 14 Oct 2015, while the LLP trace says the component was manufactured in 2020 and installed in 2021 and 2024. The release certificate is dated 25 Jul 2015. The case therefore supplies impossible chronology as ready evidence, violating AC-07’s consistent-baseline case design and distorting quality metrics."
          }
        }
